GPLv3 Section 5 Modification & Clean-Room Exclusions Notice
-----------------------------------------------------------
`ftxr-core` and `ftxr-modem` are pure-Rust ports derived from WSJT-X's classic
single-threaded FT8 (`lib/ft8/`), FT4 (`lib/ft4/`), and 77-bit (`lib/77bit/`)
implementations, modified for thread-safe session-scoped execution, warm FFT
reuse, and standalone CLI/IPC operation.

Non-GPL / Numerical Recipes routines present in upstream WSJT-X files are
explicitly excluded from this codebase and replaced with Rust standard library
or clean-room implementations:
  - `bessi0` (unused Numerical Recipes routine in `lib/ft8/ft8b.f90`)
  - `indexx` (`lib/indexx.f90`) and `shell` (`lib/shell.f90`)
  - `crc14.cpp` (Boost C++ wrapper; implemented natively in pure Rust)

